  "interventions": [
    "Set a 4-hour first-response SLA; auto-triage tickets by theme (activation, refund) and route to a specialist queue \u2014 remove the silence that turns a resolvable issue into a one-star review.",
    "Publish a real-time coverage map with honest speed tiers per country; set expectations before purchase to reduce coverage-related disappointment and the 1-star reviews that follow.",
